      "default": "<p>Yoode is an Indian fashion and custom merchandise brand redefining how organisations experience apparel. From fashion-forward athleisure to fully customised corporate merchandise, we bring together creativity, advanced technology, and strong manufacturing expertise under one roof.</p>"
